--- text
Your trial ends on [TRIAL_END_DATE]

Your [PRODUCT_NAME] trial ends on [TRIAL_END_DATE]. On that date the
[CARD_BRAND] card ending in [CARD_LAST4] will be charged
[CURRENCY] [AMOUNT] for [PLAN_NAME], and your account stays open. If
you do nothing, that is what happens.

You can confirm the plan, change it, or cancel before that date.

Your trial

Trial ends: [TRIAL_END_DATE]
Plan: [PLAN_NAME]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT] per [BILLING_PERIOD]
Payment method: [CARD_BRAND] ending in [CARD_LAST4]

Confirm your plan:

[CTA_URL]

Important: If you do not want to continue, cancel before
[TRIAL_END_DATE] and you will not be charged. You keep access to
[PRODUCT_NAME] until that date.

Cancel your trial:

[SECONDARY_URL]

If anything here does not match what you expected, reply to this
email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every
message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
